<title>PHILIPPINES: Solidbank declares 3-peso cash dividend.</title>
<headline>Solidbank declares 3-peso cash dividend.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Solidbank Corp said on Monday its board had declared a three-peso cash dividend on all issued and outstanding shares totalling 10,223,055.  </p>
<p>The record and payment date for the cash dividend have yet to fixed pending approval by the Central Bank, the bank said.</p>
<p>Solidbank paid a five-peso cash dividend in the second quarter of the year and in 1995 its cash dividends totalled 10 pesos per share.</p>
<p>--Manila newsroom (632) 841-8937</p>
</text>
